+The owned TEST checks covered simultaneous review, canonical and provider contention,
+stale challenges, source drift, ambiguous dependencies, interrupted sends, shared
+retry exhaustion, authorization, CSRF, exact and late confirmation replay, signing-key
+rotation, and decision recovery after graph purge. Earlier SET and selected-price
+regressions, backup-format compatibility, generated contracts, web checks and wheel
+installation checks passed. The 15 original pure identity cases and their source
+checks were reused. Independent cross-review covered the migration, service, UI,
+retention and grants. The review package records individual runs, corrected findings,
+exact inventory, cumulative patch and remaining verification limits.
