+seven backup-format unit cases and four Contents UI regressions. The final configured-
+account check denied a new decision on an earlier account's evidence and allowed
+exact receipt recovery. Ruff covered 25 Python files. The 22-file strict Mypy check
+passed on affected code and new integration files. Seven existing test-annotation
+diagnostics matched their baseline. The final installed-wheel and source-distribution
+check passed after the configured-account change.
